abstract: >
  A public research project that studies structural capacity, fragmentation,
  and political formation. It includes a five-pillar country diagnostic, a
  branching census across natural and social systems, a historical formation
  casebook, reproducible code, and a claims ledger that distinguishes
  descriptive, retrospective, out-of-sample, prospective, interpretive, and
  simulated evidence.
